# Cloudflare routing.
#
# Intentionally empty of rules: every route is a real directory with index.html
# (trailingSlash: true), so assets map 1:1 onto URLs, and 404 handling comes from
# `not_found_handling: "404-page"` in wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Do NOT add a `/* /404.html 404` rule: Workers only accepts status codes
# 200, 301, 302, 303, 307 and 308, so a 404 rule fails the whole deploy
# (error 100324). Unknown paths already resolve to the 404 page.
